Rāvaṇa hears exultant monkey roar and questions ministers --- Scouts report Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa freed from arrow bond --- Rāvaṇa despairs and orders Dhūmrākṣa against Rāma with monkeys --- Dhūmrākṣa musters roaring host and mounts shining chariot --- Dhūmrākṣa marches through west gate toward Hanumān amid dire omens --- Dhūmrākṣa beholds vast Rāma guarded monkey army